      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-183407",
      ":question/problem": "Use mathematical induction to prove that $(2n)! > 4^{n}$ for $n \\ge 2, n \u2208 N$.\n\nWe proceed using induction on $n$.\n\n**Base Case**: We first prove that our statement is true for the base case $n =$ {{field-1}}.\n\nFor the left-hand side, we have\n$(2 \\cdot 1)$! {{field-2}} {{field-3}}\nwhich is\n{{field-4}}\nthe right-hand side.Thus, our statement is {{field-5}} for $n = 2$."
    },
